  "title": {
   "en": "Crazy Run"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "クレイジーラン"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "After setting the fastest time in the nation for a middle school second year, Uzuki Jun is hailed as a genius runner. Expected to dominate the world of track and field, he suddenly disappears from the public eye.\nBut once he enters high school, he's back in the competitive scene! But he no longer looks like he did -- now with bleached hair and a provocative demeanor, he's far from the image of an athlete! Everyone around him is shocked, but how did his skill hold up?\nA youthful club story of setbacks, comebacks, and rivalries, centered around the \"No Guts\" strategy to take the top step in the National High School Relay Race!"
  },
